      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPRING QUEUE (4) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 8 lengths at Warragul in a handy 22.90 beating Smooth Ranger. Looks to have an edge on most of these. ENERGISER DASH (1) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fourth (22.87) in a Grade 5 at Warrnambool. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from six attempts. Should be thereabouts. SALTY SNOOP (7) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing seventh (23.55) in a Grade 5 at Geelong. Has a good record here including two wins. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Key runner on best form. MUSTANG ELEANOR (3) can feature with the right run.",
